# Externally materialized upstream Runtime and transient import staging.
# Runtime behavior is pinned by the versioned overlay manifest and product source.
# The wildcard keeps every local Runtime checkout/staging variant (import,
# backups, ad-hoc verification trees) out of the public tree: any one of them
# would leak the private Runtime source.
/packages/narrafork-runtime-private/
/packages/.narrafork-runtime-*/

# Local Runtime diagnostics, clean upstream checkout, and browser-verification artifacts.
/.novelfork-debug/
/narrafork-private-main/
/tmp-*.png
/tmp-gemini-stub.ts

